  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Consider&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mo></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>sin</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
